Package: byteguru-installer
Source: byteguru
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ByteguruOS Team <devel@byteguru.example>
Installed-Size: 91
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, partimage | ntfs-3g, gdisk, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, btrfs-progs, exfatprogs, efibootmgr, cryptsetup, debootstrap, squashfs-tools
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ByteguruOS installer with dual-boot support
 Disk layout planner working on contiguous free segments, safety gates
 (hibernation, BitLocker, dirty NTFS block the plan), EFI boot entry repair
 after Windows updates, a clock policy for machines with both systems, and a
 GTK front-end that runs the plan against a real device with confirmation.
